  "observations": [
    "U20 is grouped with its input ceramics, bootstrap/BP5 capacitors, feedback resistors and inductor in the central lower board arm.",
    "Front copper shows paired local VIN/PGND escapes and a short switch-node link to L20; boot return remains a distinct external net.",
    "Input bulk and output banks are placed but remain unrouted. Back-side configuration and feedback-top resistors still require connections.",
    "Former P_J20/P_J21/P_J106 footprints are absent; no existing route was removed. Their replacement current-return and assembly design are still pending.",
    "Existing U23 filled local planes remain in the right-hand region; there is no U20 return plane yet.",
    "Whole-board views remain substantially unrouted and do not establish fabrication readiness or installed fit."
  ],
